# Local-dev symlink to the canonical data/full_lhd_website.csv at repo root.
# The GitHub Pages workflow stages data/ into the published site so the
# relative URL `data/full_lhd_website.csv` works in production without
# needing this symlink. Create it locally so `python -m http.server` from
# frontend/ also works:
#   ln -s ../../data/full_lhd_website.csv frontend/data/full_lhd_website.csv
data/full_lhd_website.csv